PRO FORMA FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION
RESOLVED, that the Articles of Incorporation of [Corporate Name], a business corporation to be incorporated under the Business Corporations Act (Québec), be adopted in the form attached hereto, which provides for the name [Proposed Name], the registered office at [Address], and an authorized capital consisting of [X] common shares with a par value of CAD 1.00 each;
RESOLVED FURTHER, that the initial directors of the Corporation be [Director 1], [Director 2], and [Director 3], each to serve until the first annual meeting of shareholders;
RESOLVED FURTHER, that [Officer 1] be appointed President and Chief Executive Officer, [Officer 2] be appointed Secretary, and [Officer 3] be appointed Treasurer, each to hold office until the next annual meeting or until their successors are elected;
RESOLVED FURTHER, that the incorporators be and they are hereby authorized to execute and file the Articles of Incorporation with the Registre des entreprises du Québec, pay the required filing fee, and take all other actions necessary to complete the incorporation and establish the initial corporate governance structure of the Corporation.
